# Verbatim checkout: EOL conversion disabled repo-wide (no autocrlf rewriting on
# Windows environments, no renormalization). Committed content stays LF as it
# always has; multi-line source-anchor tests (e.g. CustomNodeEditorFaceTest) and
# the golden fixtures depend on the checkout form byte-for-byte - any conversion
# surface breaks them (proven on the CI windows runner: autocrlf=true CRLF'd both,
# failing TokFixtureTest's parseInt and the source anchors at once). -text only
# stops conversion and never touches index content: zero renormalization, zero
# diff noise.
* -text
